Package: nomads
Title: Nomadic Pectoral Sandpiper Movement Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mihai", "Valcu", , "mihai.valcu@bi.mpg.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bart", "Kempenaers", , "bart.kempenaers@bi.mpg.de", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Provides satellite tracking data from nomadic pectoral
    sandpipers published in Kempenaers and Valcu (2017). The data can also
    serve as benchmark data for clustering movement tracks.
